---
description: >-
  Two system boundaries (a default-type "Storefront" and a "package"-type
  "Admin Panel" with an aliased id) each containing their own use cases,
  with actors and use cases connecting both within and across boundaries.
---
usecase-beta
  direction LR
  actor Customer("Customer")
  actor Support("Support agent")
  systemBoundary Storefront
    Browse("Browse products")
    Order("Place order")
    Track("Track order")
  end
  systemBoundary admin["Admin Panel"]@{ type: package }
    Process[Process orders]
    Returns[Handle returns]
  end
  Customer --> Browse
  Customer --> Order
  Customer --> Track
  Order --> Process
  Support --> Process
  Support --> Returns
